    "systematic_number": "151.2",
    "canonical_link": "https://www.gesetzessammlung.sg.ch/app/de/texts_of_law/151.2",
    "enactment": "2010-01-01",
    "date_of_decision": "2009-04-21",
    "selected_version": {
      "xhtml_tol": "<div class='document'>\n  <h1 class='systematic_number'>\n    151.2\n  </h1>\n  <h1 class='title'>\n    Gemeindegesetz\n  </h1>\n  <h2 class='abbreviation'>\n    (GG)\n  </h2>\n  <div class='enactment'>\n    vom 21.04.2009 (Stand 01.01.2026)\n  </div>\n  <div class='ingress_author'>\n    Der Kantonsrat des Kantons St.Gallen\n  </div>\n  <div class='ingress_foundation'>\n    <p>\n      hat von der Botschaft der Regierung vom 11. M&auml;rz 2008<a class=\"footnote\" name=\"structured_documentingress_foundation_fn_8291_2_1\" href=\"#structured_documentingress_foundation_fn_8291_2_1_c\" id=\"structured_documentingress_foundation_fn_8291_2_1\">[1]</a> Kenntnis genommen und\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      erl&auml;sst\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div class='ingress_action'>\n    als Gesetz:<a class=\"footnote\" name=\"structured_documentingress_action_fn_8291_2_2\" href=\"#structured_documentingress_action_fn_8291_2_2_c\" id=\"structured_documentingress_action_fn_8291_2_2\">[2]</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class='title level_1'>\n    <span class='number_discrete'>(1.)</span> <span class='title_text'>I. Allgemeine Bestimmungen</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class='article'>\n    <div class='article_number'>\n      <span class='article_symbol'>Art.</span> <span class='number'>1</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class='article_title'>\n      <span class='title_text'>Geltungsbereich<br />\n      a) Grundsatz</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='paragraph'>\n    <span class='number'>1</span>\n    <p>\n      <span class='text_content'>Dieser Erlass regelt die Grundz&uuml;ge der Organisation und des Finanzhaushalts der Gemeinden sowie die politischen Rechte ihrer B&uuml;rgerschaft und die Aufsicht des Kantons &uuml;ber die Gemeinden.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div class='paragraph_post'></div>\n  <div class='paragraph'>\n    <span class='number'>2</span>\n    <p>\n      <span class='text_content'>Gemeinden sind:</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <table class='enumeration_item'>\n    <tr>\n      <td class='number'>\n        a)\n      </td>\n      <td class='left_col last' colspan='3'>\n        die politischen Gemeinden;\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <table class='enumeration_item'>\n    <tr>\n      <td class='number'>\n        b)\n      </td>\n      <td class='left_col last' colspan='3'>\n        die Schulgemeinden;\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <table class='enumeration_item'>\n    <tr>\n      <td class='number'>\n        c)\n      </td>\n      <td class='left_col last' colspan='3'>\n        die Ortsgemeinden und die ortsb&uuml;rgerlichen Korporationen;\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <table class='enumeration_item'>\n    <tr>\n      <td class='number'>\n        d)\n      </td>\n      <td class='left_col last' colspan='3'>\n        die &ouml;rtlichen Korporationen.\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <div class='paragraph_post'></div>\n  <div class='paragraph'>\n    <span class='number'>3</span>\n    <p>\n      <span class='abrogation_ellip'>&hellip;<strong>*</strong></span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div class='paragraph_post'></div>\n  <div class='article'>\n    <div class='article_number'>\n      <span class='article_symbol'>Art.</span> <span class='number'>2</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class='article_title'>\n      <span class='title_text'>b) Spezialgemeinden</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='paragraph'>\n    <span class='number'>1</span>\n    <p>\n      <span class='text_content'>Spezialgemeinden sind:</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <table class='enumeration_item'>\n    <tr>\n      <td class='number'>\n        a)\n      </td>\n      <td class='left_col last' colspan='3'>\n        die Schulgemeinden;\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <table class='enumeration_item'>\n    <tr>\n      <td class='number'>\n        b)\n      </td>\n      <td class='left_col last' colspan='3'>\n        die Ortsgemeinden;\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <table class='enumeration_item'>\n    <tr>\n      <td class='number'>\n        c)\n      </td>\n      <td class='left_col last' colspan='3'>\n        die ortsb&uuml;rgerlichen Korporationen;\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <table class='enumeration_item'>\n    <tr>\n      <td class='number'>\n        d)\n      </td>\n      <td class='left_col last' colspan='3'>\n        die &ouml;rtlichen Korporationen.\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <div class='paragraph_post'></div>\n  <div class='paragraph'>\n    <span class='number'>2</span>\n    <p>\n      <span class='text_content'>Bestand und Aufgaben der Schulgemeinden richten sich nach der Gesetzgebung &uuml;ber die Volksschulen.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div class='paragraph_post'></div>\n</div>\n"
    }
  }
}